{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":14.64},{"sectionId":"build","start":15.56,"end":29.76},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":30.784,"end":41.36}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.4,"text":"分支根據條件選擇行為。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":3.2,"end":7.48,"text":"上鎖的門只有在玩家持有鑰匙時才應開啟。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":7.76,"end":9.36,"text":"明確表示這個事實，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":9.6,"end":11.28,"text":"再檢查開門條件，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":11.48,"end":14.64,"text":"不要讓故事無條件跳到好結局。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":15.56,"end":16.4,"text":"在 /chapter2."},{"sectionId":"build","start":16.587,"end":18.56,"text":"py 的 take key 行動中，"},{"sectionId":"build","start":18.8,"end":22,"text":"把 state[\"has_key\"] = False 改為 True。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":22.8,"end":23.6,"text":"重播行動，"},{"sectionId":"build","start":23.92,"end":26.28,"text":"確認門能開啟。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":27.104,"end":29.76,"text":"open door 分支應檢查什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":30.784,"end":33.36,"text":"open door 分支應檢查什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":34.72,"end":38.32,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":38.72,"end":41.36,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}